==Strategy==
Though the magnification may get high, the threat level of the enemies is still lacking, and as no enemy respawns, you can easily clear this stage rather easily. The One Horns are the most threatening, but they can be brought down by a myriad of means; [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Crazed Bahamut]] clearing most of their HP, [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris]] stack destroying their hopes and dreams, [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Frog Ninja]] swarm, etc. Once the One Horns are gone, the boss attacks too little for it to be threatening, and can easily be killed.

